@startuml state-machine
' Team Bits — WRO Future Engineers 2026
' State machine of the ObstacleChallengePlanner (the OpenChallengePlanner is the same
' minus SWITCH and the parking states). One LiDAR scan = one tick of this machine.
' Render at https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml  ->  figures/software/state-machine.svg

title General Algorithm — Planner State Machine (per LiDAR scan)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F2F6FA
  BorderColor #33668E
  ArrowColor #33668E
}

[*] --> INIT

state "INIT" as INIT : wait for theta seed,\nthen branch on start pose
state "PARK_LEAVE" as LEAVE {
  [*] --> K1 : K-turn to face inner wall
  K1 --> A1 : APPROACH inner-wall standoff
  A1 --> R1 : REVERSE-OUT to segment heading
  R1 --> [*]
}
state "PARK_SETTLE" as SETTLE : dwell, read pillar colour\non motion-free frames

state "DRIVE_STRAIGHT" as STRAIGHT : gyro holds segment heading;\nlateral dead-reckoned;\nsplit end wall vs pillar
state "LANE_SWITCH" as SWITCH : drive beside the pillar\ninto the mandated lane\n(corner trigger disabled)

state "CORNER" as CORNER {
  [*] --> OUTER : outer lane
  [*] --> REVARC : centre / inner lane
  OUTER  : forward quarter-turn
  REVARC : reverse-arc turn
  OUTER  --> ALIGN
  REVARC --> ALIGN
  ALIGN  : rear-wall standoff +\nheading align (closed loop)
  ALIGN  --> [*]
}

state "FINAL PARK" as PARK : perpendicular park\n(K-turn -> drive in between walls)
state DONE

INIT --> STRAIGHT : normal start
INIT --> LEAVE    : start_in_parking\n(exit side voted)

LEAVE  --> SETTLE   : exited & aligned
SETTLE --> STRAIGHT : dwell done

STRAIGHT --> SWITCH : obstacle mandates\na different lane
SWITCH   --> STRAIGHT : lane reached

STRAIGHT --> CORNER : end wall within\nfront trigger
CORNER   --> STRAIGHT : corner_count += 1\n(grid line advanced)

STRAIGHT --> DONE : last corner passed,\nstop point reached\n(park_mode = none)
SWITCH   --> DONE : finish mid-switch\n(park_mode = none)
STRAIGHT --> PARK : stop point reached\n(park_mode set)
PARK --> DONE

DONE --> [*] : on_stop()

note right of STRAIGHT
  Turn direction (turn_sign) is latched
  once, at the first corner, from the
  LiDAR opening. Arrival lane (outer /
  centre / inner) selects the CORNER recipe.
end note

@enduml
